            <div class="eyebrow">Paused</div>
            <h2 id="pause-title">Time out</h2>
            <p>The match clock is paused too — it resumes exactly where it stopped.</p>

            <ul class="spec-list">
                <li><strong>1 · Stack the pass</strong> — <em>drag from the ball-carrier</em> onto a team-mate to
                    pass to them, or into space to play it into an area.</li>
                <li><strong>2 · Send the runners</strong> — <em>drag your players</em> to drop a ring where each of
                    them should be when the ball is played.</li>
                <li><strong>3 · Set the finish</strong> — inside range, press <strong>SHOOT</strong> to stack a shot;
                    defending, <em>drag your keeper</em> to the dive point.</li>
                <li><strong>4 · Close the window</strong> — press <strong>MOVES DONE</strong>. Both sides' moves then
                    resolve at once — nothing here happens one move at a time.</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="actions">
